    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's global convocation ceremony, celebrated in person and live-streamed on 26 February 2022, saw the graduation of 660 students from Pakistan, Kenya, Tanzania, Uganda and the UK. In addition to featuring the inauguration of President Sulaiman Shahabuddin and important announcements regarding the launch of new programs and facilities, the convocation highlighted the theme of sustainability.",
